\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Proposed ConsensusCode-Evolve pipeline. Site states and $K$ forecast features are converted into a policy-code interface. An offline LLM mutation loop proposes candidate replenishment, transshipment, and consensus-gate functions. Valid code is evaluated in the inventory simulator, selected through an archive, and deployed as executable decision logic without an online LLM call.}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
